  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee79aa6211488c3bd4cc210b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9cad68e1e1441ca841e259d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e122f2497662a36f404ea73f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐…姐姐！\n那个…早，早上好！\n…太好了，终于好好地说出来了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb114e77e85e31a53292595015b4ce07dd4783ecc504fb31b3db2450664e13e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dcc779bd90f49f64c2d918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午也请多关照！\n诶嘿嘿，很期待和姐姐\n一起的训练呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c3cf8a32b0623d97c14cb76b05665d4a036586a377762083c787e95eaff9415",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00812af5e895e09b887cedc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，姐姐。\n…让你工作到这么晚，对不起。\n米浴也要更加努力了呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4cdb00e4992ca46acc8628c730c3850fdce71fa26fc6434aef129bb33a4a999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a39ab30c921a6b0cdb84a90c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…好热呢，姐姐…\n哈呼…就像粥一样，\n要融化了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2af7a6c0033708ea59abdb1fa18597952bef99e2bec25c387dd9f2f8f567b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17276079217350362ae02d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，姐姐的脸蛋\n像苹果一样。呵呵，\n米浴的脸蛋…怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb5c6ff26af0adbc1df370b833e0bba21a1d51bcdb272e24935cf2a4c8148f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd80bbdfee2feb074bbeaa06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，你困了吗……？\r\n要吃点心吗？吃点甜食的话\r\n说不定就能清醒一些了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7853f8cc6a29665f5831f3021af996a6abb23822caba7f22fdf9ab3352ab74f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806d8ef1801cbd4e2937fb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼白天是要睡觉的吧……\r\n姐姐，有觉得累了吗？\r\n要一起睡午觉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e653f703983321077ea649cc0d83054a6c601f0774d2baab3d828d9e8e90415e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8f516dec9c3e83eabd1474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼米浴晚上也很有精神哦！\r\n姐姐，有什么我可以\r\n帮忙的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "585fd6a612b47a72bcfbf553b2af96cad1c3aafff86c352f22f79c6e9a2bc4bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be6d7902ca59fdcfb4a00a79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南瓜派、栗子蛋挞梨蛋糕\n还有红薯曲奇！\n姐姐喜欢哪个呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1444b966419039651e3435e16559e5917a365429bbbaafbc9e269a0a5dc8e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc3ec14345e97fac1e92a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然做了可怕的梦……\r\n但一见到哥哥就没事了。\r\n谢谢你……哥哥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d5198dc24ebe3a8ea36c9f9ee422982399738a8d77ce45e3368f37c0aac811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b9541ae520fe96cc994f3f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦……？欸嘿嘿，\r\n哥哥头发都睡乱了。\r\n米浴来帮你好好打理一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9831ada26214ce3484f7bd2edd66e80a89af2458bd283bab6fc29135f0f517e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d5583ce189629c58879b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为小测验很努力……\r\n和班里的大家吃了奖赏午餐。\r\n要是以后……也还能这样就好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "541dea3f228a7628ee5e3cd8f8e0086bb1150cc7fc9aea7be8b397084c603c33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb6067913da9ee14f6ab4f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，想了个可爱又好吃的便当。\r\n然后呢……今天中午\r\n想请你尝一尝……可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "371301e841537c42f1d0897fcbf8900338ee6f1afbe4320b7ab3d75cb9d1d51c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9274a61d2ec03c513ddddd9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上睡不着的时候，妈妈会给我唱歌。\r\n『胡萝卜睡觉觉，米浴也睡觉觉』\r\n……很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceb778ddba0adc739b43d8a229182e5939a85d9ea53e73a172fafd7c2e6aef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a2706a945f96a3ea452fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了夜宵哦……\r\n米、米浴的米饭之力……什么的。\r\n要是能让你打起精神来就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a3f2209ec1a109d4c779d03846f49cc3e1924f5517721b13adf655db71231fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0998444857ba9b4f493135e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发现了一颗可爱的樱花树。\r\n之后米浴打算做便当……\r\n请……请和我一起去响发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0933a0f2b70690e30a8d8505238b4452c51d60175d5078e829221dec952f387e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79d8975feec0f7010aa0ce70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，夏乏了吗……？那个，\r\n不要勉强自己哦！然后然后……\r\n加油——加油——打起精神来吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "afccbb1c7a04b836a150ec07ef96c75dbb4c02e3b70447caa06dc2d70bacb2de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:790049cd2e2edb784e8911d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……栗子胡萝卜饭真好吃啊。\r\n米浴，每天都能吃得下哦……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fd114982c517f98fda06ae90dfd704364da1771e61223f026fb999867e6e575",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2893d82db9c8c075498eaa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪天不想从被炉里出来啊……\r\n哥哥也和米浴一样……\r\n是小蜗牛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50072894d8bfe24fecf86c10f1318e44543c5c3ff9a0331ac1625547a459c0f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5a59ced7bfce32cf15dcb38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0c57929e879514221230de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然做了可怕的梦……\r\n但一见到姐姐就没事了。\r\n谢谢你……姐姐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e36105667f681967304d788ff59b656bcb190bf956fe63254919396e75979c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce8e2e4c49183233f1cb5be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦……？欸嘿嘿，\r\n姐姐头发都睡乱了。\r\n米浴来帮你好好打理一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67abfc679b5f814daecfff546dacceb58bacad5dd394118ccc4957d7621f268d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52f531ea22e0502c3d0cd84b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，夏乏了吗……？那个，\r\n不要勉强自己哦！然后然后……\r\n加油——加油——打起精神来吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "25dddd00b9c7ac6a890f98e9cb0ae28f46b4631c11ffa2c52d24c41242ffd0ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a422c35b382fb81b70f0a4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪天不想从被炉里出来啊……\r\n姐姐也和米浴一样……\r\n是小蜗牛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5f1872ea8d771d155f166413cb9845a31cde84e12f9499e57087233edc5ee89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5d9d285ecef0d9d6feef1e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总是带着笑容拼命地…\n每次看到小乌拉拉，\n就觉得米浴也要加油了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "156d11ecc5a4b261c9921c6106dcdb0dbd0d1c44d1df9c6d4a145a7980f2e2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8256402717d8ea8f3d96c43f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天打扫卫生的时候，希望不会\n把水洒出来…希望大家不会\n踩在光溜溜的地板上…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a16327848e2fae13d79046f5d4b4b064b2943b15f61120b0b586a120c998091",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:856b9a3ba80ceb40a7797b58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，啊咧？刚才还在\n那里的，进王同学…\n这就是所说的，爆进的力量…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d7c184f1bdd791b94d803c7d32b0e3e9f40018efbc2cc8957fd4006f563ace",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a04653b32ed69dd66c75bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丸善同学，为什么会\n邀请我去兜风呢…明明之前\n也塞车了…真温柔啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d928a7cd8926612a7916a078e3e2b84a274f2da4370379f7d67acd8fe773ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d68f83339e4b24d58033152f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过红绿灯的时候，\n希望谁都不要到旁边来。\n…因为米浴来了就会变成红灯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f061d48cfb67bf8d8a24ec620757bc4ae24d842bf01d034e48dec0c25664888f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e210312273d5c09a54da9930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一个人洗澡的时候，\n会悄悄地练习唱歌。\n…因为会唱的比平时好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ec855f4b61596f45e4371ab52cbeb4a820fccefbb3dadcafa334cf711f93f55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adbe4638cf205a85259a4fb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢舞台哦。\n闪闪发光的，看着舞台的大家\n都会露出笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43855dfcf0dbf3c46f035295a56ab09e7bb71856207b3eab669f8b7c3a225fea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9636135a2e34eb891aedc8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呜…因为是好不容易穿上的衣服\n所以为了不低头走着，\n撞到膝盖了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfda675c0fda4e2f86b774658ab28dda53c480912db517aed186a948ab93b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee257dbedc91e5bca5a3a8a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴也，能好好的绽放光彩吗。\n不…我相信米浴\n能成为那样的人的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50724031f3952b32ffd51c2c746991de93295b7ade7788cf6f79ff462ab38f88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ddeedf85184c6e8a1892a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼…明明每天早上都有喝牛奶、\n为什么长不大呢。\n是因为…喝的量不够吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dad309ade3a133449852e1cdd3b88e72213d1d905be519977dffed6e5835df95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1f9b2a366df8d1c3af54d92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饭后的伸展运动，做吗？\n像猫咪一样喵地伸出去，\n后背会很舒服的哦…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a4a9233047d6187c30d1a409c5ec94952a2614eb2191da8fb920efe4393a74b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5105908d83454e21a4333a32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天晚上，一定要跟荒漠英雄…\n说出『那本书我也喜欢哦』\n今晚一定…告诉她…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b16a0691122b84b812a2e3e57eacf7146d2b11e36d61935f3b44eaeb44b2804",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1829e5ca5feaf8bebc2100b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迷路的新生…米浴去打招呼的话，\n会不会添麻烦呢…？\n但是…但，但是但是…",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e6f098f72a3baf3f4b9ca8d562392cd7c8d833a877410dca7eb1f6106441da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa55eb49c42d924d09b3119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要是不会下阵雨就好了…\n哥哥会淋湿什么的，\n不行不行…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7e10a1b912d37a8a62399da8083ea971c8786416427ae3090b829cb23c5735a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d2e9705cd21ab41a933050",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落叶做成的床，就像绘本上\n描述的那样很松软吧…！\n米浴也想试试看呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e9032eaede08d1c3833f67f90db0da1da7afdcab9dceb4bf11d1e74080b1c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9fcd30b34859983c704c25c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…不，不能靠近！\n静电会啪叽啪叽的…对不起呢。\n虽然会寂寞但是要忍耐才行…",
      "source_fingerprint": "17116c2bab22a6931e7b70bb5673ca1730761551e885add5398cf4652407640d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc2e2c0106919db79d5727d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟荒漠英雄同学在房间里\r\n一起施了魔法。\r\n让明天也变成美好的一天…那种！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f33426aa768f0815caaf4803d39c589e283a893966f4d7073c3d9fb8b828a9ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc14cf82060bbc43ba7744a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "波旁同学用很快的速度\r\n做了南瓜灯……！吓了我一跳呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34e79a8c01ed436e163cd75119d8e13bc4f7da473a698ecb0e0d202cf46d9332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f34729d48da44c3aee53344",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼不能吃大蒜吐司呢……\r\n唔，现在我得忍耐一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da48bf56ca20f4a13d5003eb8f742302db61980ed33bff512943698d035d23a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:369934d69425e4fa9cb5f596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥、哥哥！\r\n不给糖果的话，就、就、就…\r\n呜呜…不捣蛋不行吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9664400724e97229f2bae9e6717921e82b5b738603585e4e9c04e0571f42ec9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fbddccbed97a5e537849fd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到南瓜，\r\n作为魔法使的马车很有名呢……！\r\n要是哪天米浴也能坐坐就好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f6fca1b5f2290709a7df284087eb62beac4e82074966ca721d38d3f08e64aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63f4da46f4542bc8aead91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做了个奇怪的梦……\r\n梦到了饿着肚子的吸血鬼……\r\n是米浴的不幸体质造成的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05360bac2c2230bb989c62dacfd9fd870b0b7ee9b634fd10a6954b11d63ccf85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9097b8e2cf008f2874039a6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在学园里走着的时候，\r\n大家给了我点心……\r\n给了这么多，要怎么办呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0beaa7b164c03d45068fad5e09c3c9f2e038712822ad1320e00d5a949f3c3ad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93500066038913e094e269d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈在睡前给我读过的绘本\r\n『小妖怪的幸福家庭』……\r\n真想和哥哥一起读一读啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd9751516cf3a67bf1dcb7d1b1eea3515fe4c283d8055cedeadfc97a7fdcaf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9b06edf020fbf110f3d38d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼不能在明亮的地方\r\n看绽放的花吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c7cd8b70a31b3f37c3d56c294f76c8227abc6eb3afb3c8153cdfc92cd3e774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b25f9eda0aa400c3567f7c57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盂兰盆舞中真的会有妖怪先生\r\n混进来吗……？说不定还会\r\n来参加胜者Live……呜欸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69020df73a18f2a1f665b421e374a345050f0ca89cc181ea4b852b4450bfcd28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac9e2c7031d595916441f5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节的准备，\r\n从装饰到点心都是大家一起做的。\r\n米浴有稍微帮到忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0f88a716219df3bf3db5de22a71f617814afa9aee402bc1b015385bc5ea884d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2360c64deef79436e5b643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "屋檐下的冰柱看起来很像牙齿……\r\n和米浴的一样呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60bd2e95e190d9d0d8604de0a1508805fc0c6e4f1bcf8ad824f396099e81fb44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bc0e2092a4c63294c9e9dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是能用背上的翅膀飞起来就好了。\r\n……希望，中途不要掉下去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f7754e81072ecf145110b4049cec7177c93654843d3ccb92b98df5ee0e926b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6b8e81d81d57b918cc7c15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实，米浴嘴里还装有牙齿哦。\r\n咿——……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0cf7c04f6364db3f340b05489a0f92b45c400c5fee7d286573d2091bbd87243",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b33d5917f0c38b468a04b59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要是不会下阵雨就好了…\n姐姐会淋湿什么的，\n不行不行…！…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6fd2fe1fcae2716480fc668d4835de03e38d85d28438928ea55b685d4416a1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06cc3fa4242acb5c851c35de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐、姐姐！\r\n不给糖果的话，就、就、就…\r\n呜呜…不捣蛋不行吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba6d59ca97e5db7844a84b67138e1a1f12535f2de26f2607397e516ede67552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b10b1058b46f9389588be2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈在睡前给我读过的绘本\r\n『小妖怪的幸福家庭』……\r\n真想和姐姐一起读一读啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d119a956ccd7cdd89ee168b63ba3f35f32585f6c3b1cf10382035d8cec578158",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b593ce451283b7659b5113ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "波旁同学说想要一个\r\n绝对不会坏的电饭煲……\r\n钻……钻石做的怎么样……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdaddcdcde97342177a51d96c9595ab25353d48738240a5df0cb4f803dc557c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd11b296bb3331b36873c192",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳神同学的『派对咖饭』\r\n好棒啊……！味道很好，彩虹色的\r\n很漂亮……米浴也想试着做一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a64eb77b52308cdc18bc6ef06f854a3cb46ecbdbfd938f616c2baa8a6be4eb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4e9618409129c6d089fc1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做料理时的大进同学……\r\n眼神很温柔呢。是像米浴一样\r\n给最喜欢的人做的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed40288d66e3bd707765000349ecc7378f579f6ee19c6842b027fc480dfcad40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f22aed0c58aa5dbc327669e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光明同学……\r\n是把米浴当成人偶了吗？\r\n她很喜欢紧紧地抱住我……啊呜",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce98452daeae74753b573bc11ccb8180ca2c6edce5c85ca186d3edc53d34ffb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5684f5fae34ec4b445d75b68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想变得像王牌同学一样\r\n可靠啊……！『交给我吧！』\r\n米浴也想说出这样的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0144c091112e72bc7cd2ea4cac970d55afb499a098acff1f840704c5b2c866f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:021ca1d59e7f94ad8302ba9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还很困吗……？\r\n可以的话，我来泡早餐咖啡吧。\r\n就算是米浴……也能做到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ab25168293bd3e9a4c7331dcfbced01cb9ce3bb22df62143be74b2de5923fe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fba31e9cc0574a3c4dfd65f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "餐厅的工作人员……真厉害啊，\r\n为大家准备了那么多午饭……\r\n好帅气……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a34c20ad0ef0b4ba86fec6a943cfade793a5e44b0b1e4a9a71e865522a99a14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24057fca372ee7732ed226c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狄杜斯同学教了我拉伸动作，\r\n今晚来试试看吧……♪\r\n要是能缓解身体僵硬就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53cf6d757a20bc4a233b4580df931bf9df21bfe18870218bef8b99e3e628d9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f9a0881182aedba8d10919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小乌拉拉一起做的樱花冰沙……\r\n下次给哥哥也带些来吧。\r\n米浴带来的，春天的馈赠……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "954bb107c2b04c05c6be42ba8bea8650289df648831909eee6f622a02bdf013b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72d330f2c291fc0bd7835113",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜欸欸……挂面又煮到溢出来了……\r\n哥哥，可以教米浴怎么煮面吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b953ea1b053cb027c633457bc02a3aa60637c5d703c3fb8e9ffee92443a6039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b8b10a5c561f6ff454e8553",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥的手……和红叶很像。\r\n很漂亮，看着就让人\r\n心里暖洋洋的……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c84fc6d449eff33ae9949ba0c4f6ae546babe71c15a16734a6c8473c67e49f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71fa19ae0dacefb48b0bd78d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜~……下雪天果然很冷啊……\r\n得多穿一点，\r\n变成暖呼呼的米浴才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d092016eab8fe691ad7362ba5836d6047d8f00f2cd3b20cd028b9544026ce439",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8bdf467f75d332f6b58fc55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "系着围裙的话，就能干劲十足……\r\n这大概也是米浴的……决胜服吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86acb81aa3f9aa7410641f214b3b8e2f1cfd7d832248ad01e0d8a573bae8b2cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc5077be40075c5b4530c9cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蔬菜和水果……大家大家都很可爱呢♪\r\n就是看久了肚子会饿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56ae1a47b0923a1dc15974d380a4da054e395be27cbea3aa86a237fe00f730e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ce22e296a881b45aedb2b4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小乌拉拉一起做的樱花冰沙……\n下次给姐姐也带些来吧。\n米浴带来的，春天的馈赠……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf98f966d2f57ccfa50c75700c5ef56e9887d785de0a52ad927279b013a30ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d246eb5c4c91477438fdac9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜欸欸……挂面又煮到溢出来了……\r\n姐姐，可以教米浴怎么煮面吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e0fcbaa3acd8c3734d060bd8b04b6679a3535367a9ca568c6a6818db02259a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c7df2f57064ae7b00739330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐的手……和红叶很像。\r\n很漂亮，看着就让人\r\n心里暖洋洋的……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a334b9c320bca8b1626d4a030b746bf4e3a53f46b4b990697dec35bf274557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce63fcc079854092d4eaf807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，今天也，\n请多多指教…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83502928935bc3cafc35ccfcac3d3ba57176f1f061dc360673a46b977ccdc5c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c63b1215733e2fce74d9e63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，要上了",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7850c14c3e3d7bdba5cb96dfefad427cb1b45e3a9328be3849489c0a3d619d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87128a00ce348f1932d967e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸～…呼～…\n…加油米浴，加油ー…\n哦ー…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2abc7295ae0f3de9006d5fe9df04648410173c18e2235d7305d086e479e9ed36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dab7ea55d31d1275a198114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么训练，\n我都会努力的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb26dff85cfb78824d3244d081d009d80618bbb5571a83ee470c34d9544b36d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
